Reading room: issue index on the left, reader on the right. SSR renders ISSUES[0] (04);
      after mount the client re-renders from ?issue= and rewrites the query with replaceState. No anchors
      exist on this page today, which is why every content link here is proposed rather than observed.

Cross-reference from the issue 03 collaboration section to the release page. Requires a
        restricted rich-text segment model (text/link) rendered identically by SSR and the client reader;
        the current data shape is plain strings, so this is an addition, not an observed anchor.
